  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">記憶體使用情況螢幕</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">在載入時顯示記憶體條，如同 1.12 Forge 啟動畫面。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>設定螢幕</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/778/2021-07-03_01h07_00.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"474\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>載入畫面</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/779/2021-07-03_01h06_29.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"474\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此外，可以透過設定鍵來顯示。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/689/2021-07-25_03.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"474\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">整合包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">請自由使用。</span></p>",
